{
  "advancement.moderndelight.alcohol.desc": "用酵母把甜水酿成酒精。喝之前，先离特斯拉线圈远一点。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.alcohol.title": "私酿时光",
  "advancement.moderndelight.all_cake.desc": "集齐九种花糕。把花园端上餐桌，也是一种浪漫。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.all_cake.title": "花吃",
  "advancement.moderndelight.all_fried.desc": "尝遍每一种油炸食品。好吃是真的，热量也是真的。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.all_fried.title": "万物皆可炸",
  "advancement.moderndelight.all_ice_lolly.desc": "做齐五种冰棍。冻得脑仁疼，也值得。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.all_ice_lolly.title": "冰棍自由",
  "advancement.moderndelight.all_mousse.desc": "集齐六种慕斯。它们轻得像是用云做的。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.all_mousse.title": "云朵收集者",
  "advancement.moderndelight.all_pudding.desc": "集齐苹果、抹茶、焦糖和樱桃四种布丁。每一只都颤颤巍巍。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.all_pudding.title": "摇摇晃晃",
  "advancement.moderndelight.all_tea.desc": "用榨汁机做出樱桃奶茶、玫瑰冰茶和芒果奶茶。秋天的第一杯，自己请自己。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.all_tea.title": "秋天的第一杯奶茶",
  "advancement.moderndelight.bamboo_steamer.desc": "用蒸屉、蒸盖和炼药锅搭一台传统蒸笼。蒸汽，就是有野心的水。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.bamboo_steamer.title": "水汽氤氲",
  "advancement.moderndelight.battery.desc": "合成任意一种电池。有了电，才有接下来的一切。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.battery.title": "电池已就位",
  "advancement.moderndelight.battery4.desc": "合成一个维度电池。电量多到需要另开一个维度来放。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.battery4.title": "还有高手？！",
  "advancement.moderndelight.bdc_bdi.desc": "合成沼气池控制器和输入输出接口。看看说明书吧，就这一次，求你了。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.bdc_bdi.title": "沼气工业",
  "advancement.moderndelight.cabinet.desc": "获得任意一种橱柜。厨房也该体面一点了。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.cabinet.title": "厨房改造",
  "advancement.moderndelight.chili.desc": "收获一根辣椒。生吃也行，后果自负。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.chili.title": "无辣不欢",
  "advancement.moderndelight.chili_sauce.desc": "做出第一瓶辣椒酱。从今天起，厨房里有了自己的味道。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.chili_sauce.title": "老干妈接班人",
  "advancement.moderndelight.click_gas_cooking_stove.desc": "在 3 秒内右键燃气灶 10 次。开始打碟——顺便把灶台点着。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.click_gas_cooking_stove.title": "燃气灶音乐家",
  "advancement.moderndelight.cooked_portable_pot.desc": "用便携锅、生石灰和水煮一碗方便面。这件事没有一处称得上方便。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.cooked_portable_pot.title": "也许并不方便",
  "advancement.moderndelight.crab.desc": "用拖网捕获一只螃蟹。它挥舞着钳子，似乎对你的菜单有意见。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.crab.title": "蟹老板",
  "advancement.moderndelight.cuisine_table.desc": "合成一张料理台。上面放工具，下面放食材，看它当场解体。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.cuisine_table.title": "万物皆可拆",
  "advancement.moderndelight.deep_fryer.desc": "合成油炸锅和油炸篮。油、燃气，以及一些不太靠谱的决定。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.deep_fryer.title": "煎熬（对食物而言）",
  "advancement.moderndelight.dim_sum.desc": "做出烧卖、水晶饺和两种包子。饮茶，是一种生活方式。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.dim_sum.title": "早茶时间",
  "advancement.moderndelight.donut.desc": "烤两个甜甜圈，然后吃掉一个。中间那个洞不算热量。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.donut.title": "甜甜圈时间",
  "advancement.moderndelight.double_burger.desc": "用面包、两份熟猪排、卷心菜和奶酪堆出双层肉霸堡。今天的健身计划，就当没发生过。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.double_burger.title": "双层快乐",
  "advancement.moderndelight.electric_steamer.desc": "合成电蒸笼。再见了，炼药锅建筑学。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.electric_steamer.title": "更上一层楼",
  "advancement.moderndelight.electric_whisk.desc": "合成一个电动搅拌器。在充电桩充好电，就能直接对着地上的掉落物搅拌。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.electric_whisk.title": "懒人厨房",
  "advancement.moderndelight.electricians_desk.desc": "合成一个电工台。它会在今后很长一段时间里陪着你。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.electricians_desk.title": "向现代化出发",
  "advancement.moderndelight.fermentation_tank.desc": "合成一个发酵罐。把液体和菌种装进去。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.fermentation_tank.title": "它活了！",
  "advancement.moderndelight.fish_and_chips.desc": "制作一份炸鱼薯条。是的，这就算一顿饭。不，豌豆不包。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.fish_and_chips.title": "英国国菜，堂堂登场",
  "advancement.moderndelight.fried_noodles.desc": "把面条下锅炸透，再用多功能包装纸包起来——这就是方便面的雏形。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.fried_noodles.title": "方便面时刻",
  "advancement.moderndelight.garlic.desc": "在森林、山地或针叶林里找到野生大蒜。对吸血鬼有效，对口气无效。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.garlic.title": "吸血鬼的最恨",
  "advancement.moderndelight.gas_canister.desc": "合成一个燃气罐。它装着燃气，也装着邻居的焦虑。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.gas_canister.title": "再靠近一点就会爆炸！",
  "advancement.moderndelight.gas_cooking_stove.desc": "合成一个燃气灶。它能加热食物、锅，以及（如果你不小心）你自己。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.gas_cooking_stove.title": "另起炉灶",
  "advancement.moderndelight.get_advance_furnace.desc": "合成高级熔炉和烤盘。速度快四倍，慌乱的幅度一点没变。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.get_advance_furnace.title": "四倍速",
  "advancement.moderndelight.get_black_pepper.desc": "在雨林里找到野生黑胡椒。它可不是从调料瓶里长出来的。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.get_black_pepper.title": "热带品种",
  "advancement.moderndelight.get_butter.desc": "把奶油搅成黄油。现在你做的每道菜都多了 40% 的热量。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.get_butter.title": "黄油，启动！",
  "advancement.moderndelight.get_cheese.desc": "让牛奶在乳酸菌手里变成奶酪。来，说茄子——镜头在拍你。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.get_cheese.title": "起司时间",
  "advancement.moderndelight.get_cream.desc": "把一桶牛奶搅成奶油。它没有变坏，只是变得更浓了。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.get_cream.title": "牛奶的第二次人生",
  "advancement.moderndelight.get_crowbar.desc": "合成一根撬棍，再用它撬碎一个方块。物理学圣剑，名不虚传。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.get_crowbar.title": "物理学不存在了",
  "advancement.moderndelight.get_egg_tart.desc": "烤一个蛋挞。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.get_egg_tart.title": "蛋挞之神",
  "advancement.moderndelight.get_freezer.desc": "合成一台冰箱。食材需要冷静，你也需要。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.get_freezer.title": "冷静一下",
  "advancement.moderndelight.get_oven.desc": "把高级熔炉升级成烤炉。天哪——它居然真的能烤。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.get_oven.title": "回炉未来",
  "advancement.moderndelight.get_pizza.desc": "把生披萨放进烤炉，顺便加上配料，黑胡椒粉、糖、黑胡椒粉——顺序别问，照做就行。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.get_pizza.title": "生活就像披萨",
  "advancement.moderndelight.get_raw_pizza.desc": "把擀平的面团放好，加入五种披萨配料，最后盖上一层奶酪。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.get_raw_pizza.title": "披萨时间到",
  "advancement.moderndelight.get_start_desc": "一份简单的模组指南，从这里开始。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.get_wheat_dough.desc": "水加面粉，再加一点点后悔。擀不擀平都行，反正都是你的面团。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.get_wheat_dough.title": "一大坨",
  "advancement.moderndelight.glass_cup.desc": "合成一只玻璃杯。接下来，就该往里面装点好喝的了。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.glass_cup.title": "半杯就好",
  "advancement.moderndelight.got_amethyst.desc": "合成一把紫水晶刀。用它了结鱿鱼，就能拿到鱿鱼骨。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.got_amethyst.title": "亮晶晶",
  "advancement.moderndelight.got_cherry_bomb.desc": "把樱桃炸弹扔出去，炸开一片。草坪上的僵尸会记住这一天的。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.got_cherry_bomb.title": "樱桃炸弹",
  "advancement.moderndelight.got_cuttlebone.desc": "用紫水晶刀击杀鱿鱼，取得鱿鱼骨。补钙，但不补智商。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.got_cuttlebone.title": "比牛奶更补钙",
  "advancement.moderndelight.got_kebabs.desc": "烤一串鱿鱼须。好吃，健康，就是签子有点扎嘴。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.got_kebabs.title": "来一串",
  "advancement.moderndelight.got_truffle.desc": "挖开灰化土，找一块松露。猪可有可无，耐心不能没有。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.got_truffle.title": "松露猎人",
  "advancement.moderndelight.got_whisk.desc": "合成一把搅拌器和一只玻璃碗。万事开头难，先把工具备齐。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.got_whisk.title": "工欲善其事",
  "advancement.moderndelight.ice_cream.desc": "看着冰淇淋机把甜筒装满。文明的意义，大概就在于此。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.ice_cream.title": "完全胜利！",
  "advancement.moderndelight.ice_cream_maker.desc": "合成一台冰淇淋机。没人能拒绝，真的没人。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.ice_cream_maker.title": "冰淇淋自由",
  "advancement.moderndelight.industrial_fermenter.desc": "合成工业发酵机。现在细菌们有工厂了，还有五险一金。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.industrial_fermenter.title": "发酵站",
  "advancement.moderndelight.juice_extractor.desc": "制作一台榨汁机。把水果交给离心力，你只管喝。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.juice_extractor.title": "离心一杯",
  "advancement.moderndelight.matcha.desc": "把树叶磨成抹茶。为了一杯绿色的水，仪式感拉满。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.matcha.title": "一抹清香",
  "advancement.moderndelight.opera_cake.desc": "烤一块歌剧蛋糕。第一口是巧克力，第二口是咏叹调。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.opera_cake.title": "歌剧魅影",
  "advancement.moderndelight.pg.desc": "制作一个光伏发电机。白天发电，晚上发呆。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.pg.title": "光合作用",
  "advancement.moderndelight.silicon_ingot.desc": "把石英丢进高炉，炼出第一块硅锭。现代化的地基，从这里开始。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.silicon_ingot.title": "硅谷",
  "advancement.moderndelight.soy_milk.desc": "把黄豆挤成豆浆。早餐的快乐，从一杯开始。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.soy_milk.title": "豆浆，中国人的咖啡",
  "advancement.moderndelight.steamed_bun.desc": "蒸一个馒头。如果不是妈妈的味道，别告诉她。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.steamed_bun.title": "是妈妈的味道",
  "advancement.moderndelight.stone_mortar.desc": "合成一个石臼。本质还是石头，只是多了研磨功能。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.stone_mortar.title": "石器时代厨房",
  "advancement.moderndelight.tesla_coil.desc": "合成一个特斯拉线圈，让电力在空中飞。爱迪生正在输入……",
  "advancement.moderndelight.tesla_coil.title": "爱迪生看了想打人",
  "advancement.moderndelight.thermal_power_generation.desc": "斯特林引擎装上工作的炉子，飞轮接上法拉第发电机。蒸汽、齿轮和电，一个都不少。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.thermal_power_generation.title": "工业革命",
  "advancement.moderndelight.trawler.desc": "合成一台拖网。都什么年代了，还用手钓鱼？",
  "advancement.moderndelight.trawler.title": "摸鱼，但是工业化",
  "advancement.moderndelight.truffle_egg_tart.desc": "吃一个松露蛋挞。普通蛋挞的价格，从此不堪回首。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.truffle_egg_tart.title": "蛋挞中的爱马仕",
  "advancement.moderndelight.vegetable_oil.desc": "用过滤器和油料作物榨出第一瓶油。接下来，锅里的东西都可以炸了。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.vegetable_oil.title": "第一桶油",
  "advancement.moderndelight.vinegar.desc": "让甜水在醋酸菌手里走一遭，得到一桶醋。酸得有理有据。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.vinegar.title": "吃醋了",
  "advancement.moderndelight.wind.desc": "合成风力发电机叶片和控制器。从此以后，电费由风来付。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.wind.title": "好风凭借力",
  "advancement.moderndelight.wither_lolly.desc": "吃下凋灵冰棍。除了凋零和黑暗，你还会收获一点点后悔。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.wither_lolly.title": "透心凉，心飞扬",
  "advancement.moderndelight.wither_rose_cake.desc": "吃下凋灵玫瑰饼，然后安静地坐着，思考你的人生。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.wither_rose_cake.title": "绽放与终结",
  "advancement.moderndelight.wooden_basin.desc": "合成一个木盆。别拿它洗脸，它是用来踩的。",
  "advancement.moderndelight.wooden_basin.title": "不是洗脸盆！",
